WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,270
Don't take off your hind legs

2
00:00:01,270 --> 00:00:03,270
Leave some seeds for our Xia Kingdom

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:04,270
On the way

4
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:05,270
Let the righteous people see

5
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:08,270
What is Xia Guo’s backbone?

6
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:09,270
Go and fire

7
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:11,270
Jiuwa, go and fire

8
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,270
Don't let the Yi clan go back alive

9
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,270
Don't let our Xia Kingdom bleed any more

10
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:18,260
What are you doing? Drive quickly

11
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,260
You dare not open fire on your compatriots

12
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,740
I have relatives for myself
